      "review_summary": "The branch replaces blocking capture-action `waitpid` with bounded `WNOHANG` polling, adds timeout/cancellation/reaper regression coverage, adds a proof script, and edits both changelogs.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection shows current main blocks in `waitpid(..., 0)`, and the PR body supplies terminal proof for bounded return through the changed waiter.",
